---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="AI 工程工具｜工程白話文 BuildScope">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>AI 工程<span>工具</span></h1><p>由生成內容升級到標準化工程流程，先由 EOT Timeline Assistant 示範開始。</p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="container tool-shell"><aside><h2>工具目錄</h2><button class="active">EOT Timeline Assistant</button><button>RFI Draft Assistant</button><button>VO Review Assistant</button><button>Site Report Assistant</button><div class="credit"><span>示範額度</span><strong>3 / 3</strong></div></aside><div class="workspace"><div class="workspace-head"><div><span>AI 工程工具</span><h2>EOT Timeline Assistant</h2></div><b>示範版</b></div><p>輸入延誤事件，系統會按日期整理初步時間線、記錄缺口及下一步行動。</p><form id="timeline-form"><div class="form-grid"><label>事件日期<input name="date" type="date" required /></label><label>事件類型<select name="type"><option>圖則／資料延誤</option><option>變更指示</option><option>場地移交</option><option>惡劣天氣</option></select></label></div><label>事件描述<textarea name="description" rows="4" placeholder="例如：顧問尚未批出幕牆施工圖，相關工序未能開始。" required></textarea></label><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">生成時間線建議</button></form><div id="result" hidden><span>初步分析結果</span><h3>建議記錄及跟進</h3><ul><li>將事件加入 Delay Event Register，記錄首次知悉日期。</li><li>核對合約通知時限及正式通訊要求。</li><li>收集 RFI、Email、Meeting Minutes、Site Diary 及相片。</li><li>連結受影響活動及最新核准 Programme。</li></ul><p class="notice">這是流程示範，不構成合約或法律意見；正式版本會按上載合約及項目資料分析。</p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>("#timeline-form");const result=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#result");form?.addEventListener("submit",(e)=>{e.preventDefault();if(result){result.hidden=false;result.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"nearest"});}});
</script>
<style>
  .tool-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;min-height:650px;border:1px solid var(--line)}aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--soft)}aside h2{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1rem}aside button{padding:13px 10px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;text-align:left;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}aside button.active{color:var(--orange-dark);border-left:3px solid var(--orange);background:white}.credit{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:auto;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.85rem}.credit strong{color:var(--orange-dark)}.workspace{padding:42px}.workspace-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.workspace-head span{color:var(--orange);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800}.workspace-head h2{margin:4px 0;font-size:2rem}.workspace-head b{color:var(--success);font-size:.8rem}.workspace>p{color:var(--body)}form{display:grid;gap:20px;margin-top:32px;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line)}label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-weight:800}.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;background:white;outline:0}input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--orange)}form .button{justify-self:start}#result{margin-top:28px;padding:28px;border-left:4px solid var(--orange);background:var(--soft)}#result>span{color:var(--orange-dark);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800}#result h3{margin:6px 0 12px}#result li{margin-bottom:7px}
  @media(max-width:760px){.tool-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}aside{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.credit{margin-top:24px}.workspace{padding:26px}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
